WEBVTT

00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:15,330
is a rebounder just as good as the vibration plate for lymphatics.

00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:20,330
Or you just have to do it for longer.

00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:24,330
For lymphatics.

00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:30,830
So the vibration plate, the benefit of the vibration plate is you get the muscle

00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:33,330
fasciculation just by standing on the plate.

00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:36,330
You're not doing any exercise.

00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:40,330
Now you can exercise on a vine plate.

00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:45,330
And then you're getting the benefit of still the muscle fasciculation and the contraction of muscles

00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:47,330
depending on what exercise you're doing.

00:00:47,330 --> 00:00:53,330
So by far the vine plate is more efficient.

00:00:53,330 --> 00:00:57,330
What's better to move lymph?

00:00:57,330 --> 00:01:00,330
That's a difficult question to answer.

00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:05,330
I'd still probably say the vine plate.

00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:08,330
Probably just because it's more efficient.

00:01:08,330 --> 00:01:12,330
So in the same amount of time that you're on the rebounder versus on the vine plate

00:01:12,330 --> 00:01:16,330
you're going to probably get a lot more muscle contraction on the vine plate.

